  "known_x1_v015_closures_required_before_reuse": [
    "Bind the frozen motion authority by hash instead of relying on legacy unbound lineage.",
    "Resolve eight fastener-before-clamped order violations and thirteen S10 tree alarms.",
    "Reconcile all 432 S7 targets in one disposition ledger; the current play table has 429 rows while the final chain accounts for 394 animated plus 38 not animated.",
    "Use stable occurrence IDs and independently cross-validate complete world matrices, not only origins.",
    "Make the connection-panel realized-edge clock consume context_deferred_fasteners, not chapter-start context time.",
    "Perform exhaustive reopened-scene motion tuple readback and issue a durable full-film human-review receipt."
  ],
  "changelog": [
    "2026-09-04 V001.1（OLSK v004 十段审片后）：新增 A12 表达层门禁——画面口径路径穿模 PATH=0（K-GOV-15）、可读性已测量（K-SCN-10）、分段审片三级缺陷为零（K-DEL-04）；未做审片时 frame_review 缺失 → UNKNOWN → HOLD（fail-closed）。"
  ]
